er!Have fun!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T05:17:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041240","verified_at":"2026-10-25T08:09:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3774220-1847286114036418","game_id":"steam-3774220","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update #4 - Farms, Seeds, Pots and reworked Challenges","summary":"Hi there! A pretty substantial update this time, including some reworks, bug fixes, and new content. Here's most of the good stuff:ChallengesThe whole Quest system has been removed, and Challenges now act as the actual Quests. You unlock them just as before - by winning a level once.Challenges are now harder overall.VikingsVikings now drop considerably less loot. Most Vikings drop loot and one other item.Bolt Vikings have been renamed and reskinned as Iron Vikings to fit the new relationship bet","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:30:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036418","verified_at":"2026-10-23T17:30:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3774220-1846651706696014","game_id":"steam-3774220","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 3 - Major Bug Fixes","summary":"Hey guys!A couple more bug fixes, including:Fixed issues with enemy spawning on wave startRemoved lag spikes on reward displayA few more minor fixesThanks again to everyone who's been playing the demo and sharing feedback!Have fun! 🏰⚔️","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T16:53:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696014","verified_at":"2026-10-21T02:50:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3774220-1846651706690251","game_id":"steam-3774220","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update - Bug Fixes, Tutorial, Extra Stats","summary":"Hey everyone!Here are a few more improvements in this update:Added a dedicated tutorial levelAdded an inspect panel that appears when clicking on SubjectsFixed several bugs, mainly related to how Subjects fetch tasksAdjusted some item values for better balanceIMPORTANT: If you have an ongoing run, playing the tutorial will require you to wipe your current level progress.Thanks to everyone who's been playing the demo and sharing feedback!Have fun!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:35:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690251","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3774220-1846651706674843","game_id":"steam-3774220","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update – Bug Fixes & Balance Changes","summary":"Hey everyone!I've just updated the demo with a few improvements:Fixed several bugsAdjusted some item values for better balanceMade a few other minor improvementsRemoved one merchant shop from the mapThanks to everyone who's been playing the demo and sharing feedback! I really appreciate the support.Have fun, and let me know what you think!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T16:12:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674843","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3774220":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:45:40Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:45:39Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3774220":"2026-10-26T00:45:40Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3774220":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T0